#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_product_catalog_dish
msgid "<em>Add the description of this dish here.</em>"
msgstr ""

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_text_block
msgid ""
"A healthy kitchen with local products. We’re constantly looking to propose "
"new products and receipts. <b>While respecting seasons' products and "
"nature.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Zdrava kuhinja z lokalnimi izdelki. Nenehno si prizadevamo ponuditi nove "
"izdelke in recepte. <b>Ob spoštovanju sezonskih pridelkov in narave.</b>"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_quotes_carousel
msgid ""
"A truly exquisite dining experience. I highly recommend the Mustard Sauce, "
"out of this world."
msgstr ""
"Resnično izvrstna kulinarična izkušnja. Toplo priporočam gorčično omako, ki "
"je iz drugega sveta."

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_text_block
msgid ""
"At the Bistro, you can expect a healthy kitchen on a daily basis. <br/>Come "
"and visit us for a Sunday brunch, healthy juices full of nutrition, or "
"delicious cakes that satisfy your sweet tooth. <b>And each day, you’ll "
"discover our Today’s Special.</b>"
msgstr ""
"V Bistru lahko vsak dan pričakujete zdravo kuhinjo. <br/>Obiščite nas na "
"nedeljskem brunchu, privoščite si zdrave sokove, polne hranilnih snovi, ali "
"okusne torte, ki bodo potešile vašo sladkosnednost. <b>Vsak dan boste "
"odkrili tudi našo današnjo posebno ponudbo.</b>"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_features
msgid "Breakfast"
msgstr "Zajtrk"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_quotes_carousel
msgid ""
"Cosy and friendly, good atmosphere and super food. Especially the spiced "
"fruit crumble."
msgstr ""
"Prijetno in prijazno, dobro vzdušje in super hrana. Še posebej začinjen "
"sadni drobljenec."

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_cover
msgid ""
"Daily fresh products combined with our professional yet convivial "
"service<br/> to create a true gastronomic experience."
msgstr ""
"Dnevno sveži izdelki v kombinaciji z našo profesionalno, a prijazno "
"postrežbo<br/> ustvarjajo pravo gastronomsko doživetje."

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_features
msgid "Dinner"
msgstr "Večerja"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_features
msgid ""
"Enjoy tasty food with friends.<br/><small>From <b>6:30 pm</b> to <b>10:30 "
"pm</b></small>"
msgstr ""
"Uživajte v okusni hrani s prijatelji.<br/><small>Od <b>18.30</b> do <b>"
"22.30</b></small>"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_features
msgid ""
"Help you start your morning right.<br/><small>From <b>7:30 am</b> to "
"<b>10:30 am</b></small>"
msgstr ""
"Pomagamo vam dobro začeti jutro.<br/><small>Od <b>7:30</b> do <b>10:30</b></"
"small>"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_features
msgid "Lunch"
msgstr "Obrok"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_cover
msgid "Our Menu"
msgstr "Naš meni"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_cover
msgid "Seasonal<br/> Flavors"
msgstr "Sezonski<br/> Okusi"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_features
msgid ""
"Take a break from your busy schedule.<br/><small>From <b>11:30 am</b> to "
"<b>2:30 pm</b></small>"
msgstr ""
"Vzemite si odmor od svojega natrpanega urnika.<br/><small>Od <b>11:30</b> do "
"<b>14:30</b></small>"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_picture
msgid ""
"Taste our chef's special, an almond macaroon with orange blossom "
"buttercream."
msgstr ""
"Poskusite specialiteto našega chefa, mandljev makron z masleno kremo iz "
"pomarančnih cvetov."

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_banner
msgid "Tasty Meals"
msgstr "Okusne jedi"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_picture
msgid "The perfect dessert to share for the table."
msgstr "Popolna sladica za skupno uživanje pri mizi."

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model:ir.model,name:theme_bistro.model_theme_utils
msgid "Theme Utils"
msgstr "Pomožni pripomočki teme"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_quotes_carousel
msgid "This place is perfect for groups or a casual date night."
msgstr "Ta kraj je idealen za skupine ali sproščen zmenek."

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_picture
msgid "Today's special"
msgstr "Današnja posebna ponudba"
